 354:../../applications/examples/lora-gps-example/src/lora-gps-example.c ****     // Wait to be notified that the transmission is complete.  Note the first
 355:../../applications/examples/lora-gps-example/src/lora-gps-example.c ****     //parameter is pdTRUE, which has the effect of clearing the task's notification
 356:../../applications/examples/lora-gps-example/src/lora-gps-example.c ****     //value back to 0, making the notification value act like a binary (rather than
